        "Description": "Hitman 4-7, this is General Zaydan. We have been tracking Héctor ever since he left America, and now he has returned home.Take out the Cartel&apos;s leaders. We have more information on Novikov. We learned he has plans to start WW3, and thathe has his own private Militia, and personal Paramilitary Security unit based out of Russia, called CICADA. He has placed multiple Militia Units in various parts of the World. Good luck.\r\r[REMAKE OF PS CONTRACT BY &quot;ContractsAgency&quot;]",
